WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.049
Oh, hi! Who are you?

2
00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:15.336
I'm an Eastern box turtle.

3
00:00:15.337 --> 00:00:19.141
Turtles are reptiles.

4
00:00:19.142 --> 00:00:21.700
Where do you live?

5
00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:27.429
Eastern box turtles live in the United States.

6
00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:33.591
We like forests, meadows, and marshes.

7
00:00:33.592 --> 00:00:36.733
Do you like the water?

8
00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:41.818
We usually live near ponds and streams.

9
00:00:41.819 --> 00:00:46.054
We go in the water to cool off.

10
00:00:46.055 --> 00:00:49.112
I like your shell.

11
00:00:49.113 --> 00:00:53.357
Our shells are very hard.

12
00:00:53.358 --> 00:00:57.682
We can hide inside them.

13
00:00:57.683 --> 00:01:02.512
That protects us from enemies.

14
00:01:02.513 --> 00:01:05.281
What do you eat?

15
00:01:05.282 --> 00:01:10.904
Older Eastern box turtles mostly eat plants.

16
00:01:10.905 --> 00:01:18.043
But younger ones like fish, snails, and bugs.

17
00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:20.905
How long do you live?

18
00:01:20.906 --> 00:01:25.689
We can live for a long time.

19
00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:31.538
Some of us live over a hundred years!

20
00:01:31.539 --> 00:01:34.606
Do you lay eggs?

21
00:01:34.607 --> 00:01:40.536
Yes, we dig holes with our back legs.

22
00:01:40.537 --> 00:01:45.559
Then we lay eggs in the hole.

23
00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:52.876
Babies crawl out three months later.

24
00:01:52.877 --> 00:01:55.630
I see a fox!

25
00:01:55.631 --> 00:02:00.450
I'm going to hide in my shell.

26
00:02:00.451 --> 00:02:07.814
Good-bye, Eastern Box Turtle!

